00:00:47.986 --> 00:00:49.163
ELDERLY AND THOSE WITH

00:00:49.197 --> 00:00:50.190
PREEXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS

00:00:50.192 --> 00:00:51.974
ARE AT A HIGHER RISK FOR SEVERE

00:00:52.009 --> 00:00:53.205
ILLNESS SO IT’S A REALLY GOOD

00:00:53.239 --> 00:00:54.985
QUESTION WHETHER OR  NOT THOSE

00:00:54.986 --> 00:00:56.061
WITH EXISTING MEDICAL

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:57.412
CONDITIONS CAN TAKE THE VACCINE,

00:00:57.413 --> 00:00:59.406
AND WHEN YOU LOOK AT THE SAFETY

00:00:59.407 --> 00:01:00.554
