00:01:06.547 --> 00:01:08.217
WHICH IS A GOOD THING BECAUSE

00:01:08.251 --> 00:01:10.090
ABOUT 40% OF AMERICANS HAVE SOME

00:01:10.092 --> 00:01:11.612
