00:01:18.695 --> 00:01:19.978
AND THOSE PEOPLE ABSOLUTELY

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.406
SHOULD BE GETTING THE VACCINE.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:22.964
WHAT WAS NOT INCLUDED IN THE

00:01:22.965 --> 00:01:24.337
