00:01:27.872 --> 00:01:29.870
SO YOU DON’T USUALLY INCLUDE

00:01:29.904 --> 00:01:32.299
THEM IN THE FIRST STAGES OF THE

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.541
CLINICAL TRIAL; HOWEVER WHAT

00:01:33.576 --> 00:01:35.380
THE CDC AND A LOT OF THE

00:01:35.382 --> 00:01:36.933
SPECIALTY EXPERT GROUPS ARE

00:01:36.935 --> 00:01:38.510
