00:01:38.511 --> 00:01:39.694
BENEFIT FAR OUT WEIGHS THE

00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:40.727
RISK IN THESE GROUPS.

00:01:40.728 --> 00:01:42.233
YES IT HASN’T BEEN TESTED IN

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.369
THESE GROUPS BUT IT DOESN’T MEAN

00:01:43.404 --> 00:01:44.772
THAT THE VACCINE ISN’T GOING TO

00:01:44.806 --> 00:01:45.359
BE SAFE.

00:01:45.393 --> 00:01:47.204
THE BIGGEST CONCERN IS WILL THE

00:01:47.205 --> 00:01:48.381
VACCINE ACTUALLY WORK IN

00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:49.105
