00:01:52.748 --> 00:01:54.466
RACHEL, AS YOU KNOW, I MYSELF

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:55.731
HAVE AN AUTOIMMUNE DISEASE AND

00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:56.930
THIS IS A BIG QUESTION THAT I

00:01:56.964 --> 00:01:57.410
HAD.

00:01:57.445 --> 00:02:00.478
