00:02:03.796 --> 00:02:05.383
CAN I GET THE VACCINE?

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:06.968
WILL IT PUT ME INTO A BIG

00:02:06.969 --> 00:02:07.514
AUTOIMMUNE FLARE?

00:02:07.515 --> 00:02:10.213
WILL, BECAUSE OF THE MEDICATION

00:02:10.214 --> 00:02:11.841
I’M ON, WILL I EVEN MOUNTAIN

00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:13.191
IMMUNE RESPONSE TO THE VACCINE

00:02:13.226 --> 00:02:15.001
AND THE ANSWER IS, WE DON’T

00:02:15.002 --> 00:02:16.920
REALLY KNOW, BUT WHAT WE DO KNOW

00:02:16.921 --> 00:02:19.162
IS THIS VACCINE IS INCREDIBLY

00:02:19.163 --> 00:02:21.615
SAFE UNLESS YOU HAVE A KNOWN

00:02:21.649 --> 00:02:22.812
SEVERE ALLERGIC REACTION HISTORY

00:02:22.846 --> 00:02:24.199
, SO EVERYONE PROBABLY

00:02:24.201 --> 00:02:25.965
SHOULD BE GETTING THIS VACCINE,

00:02:25.966 --> 00:02:27.476
UNDER THE GUIDANCE OF THEIR

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:28.948
DOCTOR, AND WE HAVE CLINICAL

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.275
TRIALS NOW UNDERGOING TO MAKE

00:02:30.277 --> 00:02:31.930
SURE THAT THESE PEOPLE ARE ALSO

00:02:31.932 --> 00:02:32.861
GETTING THAT IMMUNITY THAT THEY

00:02:32.862 --> 00:02:33.148
NEED.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.605
WE DON’T KNOW IF IT’S GOING TO

00:02:35.606 --> 00:02:37.281
BE THAT SAME 95% EFFICACY BUT

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:38.796
ANY SORT OF IMMUNITY IS GOING TO

00:02:38.831 --> 00:02:41.221
