00:02:51.093 --> 00:02:52.689
IT SEEMS THAT I SHOULD BE TAKING

00:02:52.691 --> 00:02:54.303
IT BECAUSE IT’LL NOT ONLY HELP

00:02:54.305 --> 00:02:55.662
