00:02:55.664 --> 00:02:57.189
HELP THOSE AROUND ME, AND SO

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:59.205
WHEN IT IS MY TURN, I ABSOLUTELY

00:02:59.206 --> 00:03:00.655
